  "body": "Elevated to enjoy a peaceful outlook and gentle coastal glimpses, this generous 258sqm (approx.) home delivers modern comfort and flexible living across a well-proportioned 503sqm (approx.) section. Designed with busy families and multi-generational living in mind, it offers a thoughtful layout, great separation of spaces, and the reassurance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\n*  Two-bedroom granny potential with its own living area and bathroom\r\n*  Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living zone\r\n*  Designer kitchen with premium appliances, generous island, and walk-in pantry\r\n*  Seamless flow to a large Kwila deck and landscaped garden\r\n*  Peaceful reserve outlook and distant views towards Orewa\r\n*  Master suite with walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite\r\n*  Three additional bedrooms plus a practical study nook\r\n*  Central air-conditioning system through the main part of the home\r\n*  Heat pump in the granny area\r\n*  Built-in sound system & Intercom\r\n*  Double internal-access garage with laundry nook\r\n*  Handy under-stairs storage\r\n\r\nSet within the highly sought-after Millwater community, this home brings together versatility, comfort, and a lifestyle close to schools, parks, cafés, motorway links, Silverdale Shopping Centre, and Orewa Beach. A modern, adaptable residence designed to support every stage of family living with ease and style.\r\n\r\nFor more information or to book a time to visit, contact Shaun Burnett on 021 871 252",
